---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="Background, research interests, and recent experience of Abdurakhmon Dadaboev.">
  <header class="page-header">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>About me</h1>
    <p class="profile-line">AI Vision Engineer · Data Scientist</p>
  </header>

  <section class="bio">
    <img src="/images/about-portrait-2026.jpg" width="1014" height="1280" alt="Abdurakhmon Dadaboev" />
    <div>
      <p>I grew up in Uzbekistan, where my education began with art. From September 2008 to May 2013, I studied Fine Arts at the <a class="institution-link" href="https://art-academy.uz/blog/news/ozbekiston-tasviriy-va-amaliy-sanatini-yanada-rivojlantirishda-andijon-maktabining-orni" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Andijan Specialized Boarding School of Arts</a>. Living in the dormitory for five years introduced me to a structured daily routine and taught me discipline, independence, and consistency. Studying drawing also trained me to notice shape, proportion, contrast, and small visual differences.</p>
      <p>I then studied automated systems maintenance and commissioning at the <a class="institution-link" href="https://institutions.ziyonet.uz/object/show/20815" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Andijan College of Transport and Services</a> from September 2013 to June 2016. I learned the foundations of industrial automation, electrical and mechanical systems, pneumatics, hydraulics, sensors, and control technology. Practical work with a Festo Didactic production training system showed me how individual components work together in a complete factory process.</p>
      <p>In 2017, I moved to South Korea to study Korean and later earned a degree in Electronic Engineering at <a class="institution-link" href="https://electric.sunmoon.ac.kr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sun Moon University</a>. During university, I became interested in data science and AI. I completed a master’s degree in Big Data Science at <a class="institution-link" href="https://bigdatascience.korea.ac.kr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Korea University</a>, where I worked on road data, semantic segmentation, image retrieval, and offline OCR. These projects taught me that useful AI starts with understanding the data and the environment in which a system will be used.</p>
      <p class="bio-after-image">My background is also international. I represented Uzbek students for two years, helped organize cultural events, and learned to work across Uzbek, Korean, English, and Russian. Moving between countries, languages, art, engineering, and data science has made me comfortable learning unfamiliar things and collaborating with people who approach problems differently.</p>
      <div class="bio-links"><a href="/resume">View resume</a><a href="/research-and-projects">View projects</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-section">
    <h2>Research interests</h2>
    <div class="interest-grid">
      <div><h3>Computer vision</h3><p>Image segmentation, classification, retrieval, OCR, and knowledge distillation.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Data curation</h3><p>Collection rules, metadata filtering, duplicate analysis, labeling, and human review tools.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Practical systems</h3><p>Offline inference, memory limits, API workflows, reproducible evaluation, and structured outputs.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-section">
    <h2>Experience and education</h2>
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-meta">Jul 2026 to present</div><div><div class="timeline-title">North American Road Data and Automatic Labeling</div><div class="timeline-subtitle">Hyundai Motor Genesis Chassis Test Team · Vegas · Korea University</div><div class="timeline-content"><p>Developing a Mapillary based collection pipeline, DINOv3 and FAISS retrieval workflow, and manual review tool for road image curation.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-meta">Jul 2026</div><div><div class="timeline-title">AI Vision Research Intern</div><div class="timeline-subtitle">Youngchang Labs</div><div class="timeline-content"><p>Worked on road image dataset construction, analysis, and computer vision model development.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-meta">Feb 2026 to present</div><div><div class="timeline-title">Offline Exam OCR System</div><div class="timeline-subtitle">Big Data Mining Lab · Korea University</div><div class="timeline-content"><p>Developing PDF alignment, OMR based student matching, answer extraction, OCR, and result storage.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-meta">Mar to Dec 2025</div><div><div class="timeline-title">Road Damage Detection Research</div><div class="timeline-subtitle">Crowdsourced Mobility Support · R2320973</div><div class="timeline-content"><p>Redesigned crack annotations from boxes to polygons and developed a tested road damage segmentation and severity pipeline.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-meta">2024 to Aug 2026</div><div><div class="timeline-title">M.S. Big Data Science</div><div class="timeline-subtitle"><a class="institution-link" href="https://bigdatascience.korea.ac.kr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Korea University, Sejong</a> · GPA 4.46/4.5</div></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-meta">2019 to 2023</div><div><div class="timeline-title">B.S. Electronic Engineering</div><div class="timeline-subtitle"><a class="institution-link" href="https://electric.sunmoon.ac.kr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sun Moon University</a> · GPA 4.18/4.5</div></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-meta">Sep 2013 to Jun 2016</div><div><div class="timeline-title">Automated Systems Maintenance and Commissioning</div><div class="timeline-subtitle"><a class="institution-link" href="https://institutions.ziyonet.uz/object/show/20815" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Andijan College of Transport and Services</a></div><div class="timeline-content"><p>Studied industrial automation, electrical and mechanical systems, pneumatics, hydraulics, sensors, and control technology.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-meta">Sep 2008 to May 2013</div><div><div class="timeline-title">Fine Arts</div><div class="timeline-subtitle"><a class="institution-link" href="https://art-academy.uz/blog/news/ozbekiston-tasviriy-va-amaliy-sanatini-yanada-rivojlantirishda-andijon-maktabining-orni" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Andijan Specialized Boarding School of Arts</a></div><div class="timeline-content"><p>Completed five years of visual arts education in a residential school environment.</p></div></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-section details">
    <div><h2>Tools</h2><p>Python, PyTorch, OpenCV, Ultralytics YOLO, DINOv3, FAISS, SQLite, Git, and Jupyter.</p></div>
    <div><h2>Languages</h2><p>Uzbek (native), Korean (TOPIK Level 6), English, and Russian.</p></div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .page-header { max-width: 48rem; padding-bottom: 2rem; }
    .profile-line { margin-top: 0.65rem; color: var(--accent); font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 650; }
    .bio { display: flow-root; padding: clamp(1.4rem, 4vw, 2.2rem); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
    .bio img { width: clamp(14rem, 21vw, 18rem); height: auto; float: left; margin: 0 clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem) 1rem 0; border-radius: var(--radius-md); object-fit: cover; object-position: center top; }
    .bio p { margin-bottom: 0.8rem; font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.78; }
    .bio-after-image { clear: both; }
    .bio-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
    .bio-links a { color: var(--accent); font-size: 0.94rem; font-weight: 600; }
    .about-section { padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 5rem); }
    .about-section > h2 { margin-bottom: 1.4rem; }
    .interest-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
    .interest-grid > div { padding: 1.4rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
    .interest-grid h3 { margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
    .interest-grid p { font-size: 0.97rem; }
    .about-section .timeline { display: grid; gap: 0.8rem; border-top: 0; }
    .about-section .timeline-item { padding: 1.25rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
    .details { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
    .details > div { padding: 1.4rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
    .details h2 { margin-bottom: 0.45rem; font-size: 1.2rem; }
    .details p { font-size: 0.97rem; }
    @media (max-width: 760px) { .bio img { width: min(100%, 20rem); float: none; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; } .interest-grid, .details { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  </style>
</Layout>
